  "problem_statement": "In the lwIP-backed socket API, the timeout argument is specified in microseconds. A positive timeout below 1 ms must not be treated as an infinite timeout. sock_tcp_accept(), sock_tcp_read(), sock_ip_recv(), and sock_udp_recv() must return -ETIMEDOUT when given a sub-millisecond timeout, rather than blocking indefinitely.",
